---
// Bold phrase with a pink underline, used to stress key words in a paragraph.
---

<strong class="highlight"><slot /></strong>

<style>
	.highlight {
		font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
		text-decoration-line: underline;
		text-decoration-color: var(--color-highlight-pink);
		text-decoration-thickness: var(--size-underline);
		text-underline-offset: var(--size-underline-offset);
		text-decoration-skip-ink: none;
	}
</style>
